Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 04:29:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] docs: bring todo.md in line with the code

Every item was checked off, but diffing against todo.md_bkup shows the
rewrite dropped unfinished items rather than completing them, including
"show the last cards discarded" -- whose backend half had shipped and
frontend half had not.

Two entries were also wrong. "Retroactive Jester power application"
described the over-broad behaviour now restricted to Spades, and "Diamond
Draw Test: Verified clockwise draw logic" claimed verification from a test
that failed one run in four.

Adds an Open section for what is genuinely outstanding, notably three
backend gaps: no seat authorization on the socket, every hand broadcast to
every client, and silently swallowed action errors.
